{"meta":{"id":"tt5421602","type":"series","name":"Anne with an E","description":"Anne Shirley es una niña huérfana que vive en un pequeño pueblo llamado Avonlea que pertenece a la Isla del Príncipe Eduardo, en el año 1890. Después de una infancia difícil, donde fue pasando de orfanato a hogares de acogida, es enviada por error a vivir con una solterona y su hermano. Cuando cumple 13 años, Anne va a conseguir transformar su vida y el pequeño pueblo donde vive gracias a su fuerte personalidad, intelecto e imaginación. Basada en la inolvidable novela.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6P6tXhjT5tK3qOXzxF9OMLlG7iz.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/70YdbMELM4b8x8VXjlubymb2bQ0.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gtqNjjM2wXmTnbTvMP3xYAXaLrU.png","genres":["Drama","Familia"],"releaseInfo":"2017-2019","released":"2017-03-19T00:00:00.000Z","imdbRating":"8.7","runtime":"47 min","trailers":[{"source":"kdaDb8W8LZ8","type":"Trailer"}],"cast":["Amybeth McNulty","Geraldine James","R.H. Thomson","Lucas Jade Zumann","Joanna Douglas"],"director":["Moira Walley-Beckett"],"writer":["Lucy Maud Montgomery"],"links":[{"name":"Amybeth McNulty","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Amybeth%20McNulty"},{"name":"Geraldine James","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Geraldine%20James"},{"name":"R.H. Thomson","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=R.H.%20Thomson"},{"name":"Lucas Jade Zumann","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Lucas%20Jade%20Zumann"},{"name":"Joanna Douglas","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Joanna%20Douglas"},{"name":"Moira Walley-Beckett","category":"Directors","url":"stremio:///search?search=Moira%20Walley-Beckett"},{"name":"Lucy Maud Montgomery","category":"Writers","url":"stremio:///search?search=Lucy%20Maud%20Montgomery"}],"app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Amybeth McNulty","character":"Anne Shirley","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/5U8lw3U3spt7Q70r